l17: $ G , n = cdm q1 , z = ∅ , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel ⇒ kc_pi ∈ ω $ by kc_pi_omega
l18: $ G , n = cdm q1 , z = ∅ , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel ⇒ h ∊ trees ω ∧ l ∊ trees ω $ by trees_kids2 [l16, l15, wcel_isset [l17]]
l19: $ G , n = cdm q1 , z = ∅ , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
