l27: $ G , n = cdm q1 , z = ∅ , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ l = l $ by eq_refl
l28: $ G , n = cdm q1 , z = ∅ , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l29: $ G , n = cdm q1 , z = ∅ , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w q $ by wcel_eq_r [etel_eq [l27, l28, eq_sym [l24]], and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l23]]]]
