l285: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 $ by ax
l286: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#3]
l287: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ h ∊ trees ω ∧ l ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [l171]
l288: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ $ by weaken [l167]
l289: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ u = u $ by eq_refl
l290: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ M = M $ by eq_refl
l291: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x3 = x3 $ by eq_refl
l292: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ dt u M x1 w x3 = dt u M ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ w x3 $ by dt_eq [l289, l290, l288, l181, l291]
l293: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ dt u M ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ w x3 = cpi i (dt u M h w x3) (dt u M l w (scons i x3)) $ by dt_pi [welc_wcel [and_elim_l [l287]], welc_wcel [and_elim_r [l287]], l286, l284]
l294: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x4 ∊ cpi i (dt u M h w x3) (dt u M l w (scons i x3)) $ by welc_eq [eq_trans [l292, l293], l285]
l295: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 $ by and_elim_l [l283]
l296: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x ∊ dt u M h w x3 $ by weaken [l295]
