l370: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = h ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_indapp a b c d h j ∈ lrel ⇒ nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) $ by wcel_eq_l [eq_sym [l369], l365]
l371: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = h ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_indapp a b c d h j ∈ lrel ⇒ ∃ o ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 o ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' o ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) $ by lrel_indapp_shape [l340, l325, l327, l329, l328]
l372: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ x3' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = h ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_indapp a b c d h j ∈ lrel , ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) x1 w x3) = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) x1 w x3) ⇒ ∃ o ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 o ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' o ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 = e ++ swin x3 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) $ by weaken [l371]
