l166: $ G , m = nvf' t2 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_pi x1 x2 t3 ∈ lrel → nvf' x2 = k → ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → ∃ o (o ∊ fseq u ∧ x6' k = etel u (dnf u M) t3 w o ∧ x5' k ∈ dt u M t3 w o ∧ ∀ i (i ∊ ω → o' (nadd k i) = x3' i))) , z = suc k , ra_nth_pi x1 x2 t3 ∈ lrel , nvf' x2 = z , ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons d (scons c ∅) ⟩ ∧ x2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons j ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = b ∧ ra_nth_pi c j b ∈ lrel , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' d) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) c w (scons x x3) ∧ x4 = ssnoc f x ∧ x5 = scons x g ∧ x6 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) d w x3) t , q = scons x x3 , o ∊ fseq u ∧ t' k = etel u (dnf u M) t3 w o ∧ g' k ∈ dt u M t3 w o ∧ ∀ i (i ∊ ω → o' (nadd k i) = q' i) , i ∊ ω , l = suc i ⇒ z = suc k $ by ax
