l209: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J → x1 ∊ trees ω → x2 ∊ trees ω → cdm x5 = k → x4 ∊ fseq u → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 → ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t5 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x4 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , x2 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ra_indapp t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t5 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ dt u M x1 w x4 = apn (x4' (nadd (nadd (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3)) (nvf' t5))) (sarg u (dnf u M) x1 w x4) $ by lrel_indapp_sem [l203, l204, l205, l207]
l210: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J → x1 ∊ trees ω → x2 ∊ trees ω → cdm x5 = k → x4 ∊ fseq u → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 → ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t5 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = nvf' m ∧ x8 = e ++ swin x4 (nvf' x2) (nvf' t3) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3))) , z = suc k , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , x2 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ra_indapp t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t5 ∈ lrel ⇒ ∃ m (ra_nidx t1 t5 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) x1 w x4) = nadd (nvf' m) (nvf' t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) x1 w x4)) $ by lrel_indapp_cnt [l203, l206, l205, l207]
