l30: $ G , n = cdm p1 , z = ∅ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ⟨ x9 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x0 , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , b ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ b ∊ u ∧ ⟨ a , ⟨ e , ⟨ p , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons b x4) ∧ x9 = ssnoc a b ∧ x6 = scons b e ∧ x0 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) p , q = scons x x4 ⇒ l = l $ by eq_refl
l31: $ G , n = cdm p1 , z = ∅ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ⟨ x9 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x0 , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , b ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ b ∊ u ∧ ⟨ a , ⟨ e , ⟨ p , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons b x4) ∧ x9 = ssnoc a b ∧ x6 = scons b e ∧ x0 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) p , q = scons x x4 ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l32: $ G , n = cdm p1 , z = ∅ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ⟨ x9 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x0 , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , b ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ b ∊ u ∧ ⟨ a , ⟨ e , ⟨ p , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons b x4) ∧ x9 = ssnoc a b ∧ x6 = scons b e ∧ x0 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) p , q = scons x x4 ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w q $ by wcel_eq_r [etel_eq [l30, l31, eq_sym [l27]], and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l26]]]]
l33: $ G , n = cdm p1 , z = ∅ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ⟨ x9 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x0 , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , b ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ b ∊ u ∧ ⟨ a , ⟨ e , ⟨ p , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons b x4) ∧ x9 = ssnoc a b ∧ x6 = scons b e ∧ x0 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) p , q = scons x x4 ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f $ by etel_fseq [welc_wcel [l29], l32]
l34: $ G , n = cdm p1 , z = ∅ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ⟨ x9 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x0 , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , b ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ b ∊ u ∧ ⟨ a , ⟨ e , ⟨ p , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons b x4) ∧ x9 = ssnoc a b ∧ x6 = scons b e ∧ x0 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) p , q = scons x x4 ⇒ f ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [l33]
l35: $ G , n = cdm p1 , z = ∅ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ⟨ x9 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x0 , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , b ∊ da ((dnf u M)' h) w x4 ∧ b ∊ u ∧ ⟨ a , ⟨ e , ⟨ p , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons b x4) ∧ x9 = ssnoc a b ∧ x6 = scons b e ∧ x0 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) p , q = scons x x4 ⇒ cdm (ssnoc f x) = suc (cdm f) $ by ssnoc_len [l34]
