l39: $ G , iprt td x1 x2 ∧ nvf' x3 = j ∧ ra_nth_ty x2 x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ nvf' x6 = c ∧ ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 K ∈ lrel ⇒ ∃ k (iminx td j c k) $ by isset_elim [wcel_isset [l12], l38]
l40: $ G , ∃ x6 (iprt td x1 x2 ∧ nvf' x3 = j ∧ ra_nth_ty x2 x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ nvf' x6 = c ∧ ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 K ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x6 (iprt td x1 x2 ∧ nvf' x3 = j ∧ ra_nth_ty x2 x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ nvf' x6 = c ∧ ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 K ∈ lrel) $ by ax
