l12: $ G ⇒ ra_has_arg ty t2 ∈ lrel → ⟨ va , ⟨ vb , ⟨ vc , vo ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ty w r1 → ⟨ vd , ⟨ ve , ⟨ vf , vn ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ty w r2 → ∀ x0 (vo' x0 = vn' x0) → dt u M t2 w r1 = dt u M t2 w r2 $ by imp_elim [l11, #4]
