l105: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_app , scons x (scons q ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = z ∧ ra_has_arg x z ∈ lrel , b = ∅ ∧ ⟨ b , ⟨ b , ⟨ b , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w r1 ∧ vb = b ∧ vo = scons (da ((dnf u M)' q) w r1) a , m = ∅ ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ m , ⟨ m , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w r2 ∧ ve = m ∧ vn = scons (da ((dnf u M)' q) w r2) l ⇒ r1 ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#6]
l106: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_app , scons x (scons q ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = z ∧ ra_has_arg x z ∈ lrel , b = ∅ ∧ ⟨ b , ⟨ b , ⟨ b , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w r1 ∧ vb = b ∧ vo = scons (da ((dnf u M)' q) w r1) a , m = ∅ ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ m , ⟨ m , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w r2 ∧ ve = m ∧ vn = scons (da ((dnf u M)' q) w r2) l ⇒ r2 ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#7]
l107: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_app , scons x (scons q ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = z ∧ ra_has_arg x z ∈ lrel , b = ∅ ∧ ⟨ b , ⟨ b , ⟨ b , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w r1 ∧ vb = b ∧ vo = scons (da ((dnf u M)' q) w r1) a , m = ∅ ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ m , ⟨ m , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w r2 ∧ ve = m ∧ vn = scons (da ((dnf u M)' q) w r2) l ⇒ dt u M t2 w r1 = dt u M t2 w r2 $ by f9_ha_e [wcel_welc [l80], l104, l105, l106, l82, and_elim_l [and_elim_r [l73]], l103, l101]
