l120: $ G ⇒ dt u M t2 w r1 = dt u M t2 w r2 $ by or_elim [l1, l51, l119]

lemma f9_ha_all (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w r1 r2 t2: set): $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 $
----
l1: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 $ by ax
l2: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ by ax
l3: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by ax
l4: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
l5: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by ax
l6: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ r1 ∊ fseq u $ by ax
l7: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ r2 ∊ fseq u $ by ax
l8: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel $ by ax
l9: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 $ by ax
l10: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 $ by ax
l11: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) $ by ax
l12: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 , ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) ⇒ dt u M t2 w r1 = dt u M t2 w r2 $ by f9_ha_n [l1, l2, l3, l4, l5, l6, l7, l8, l9, l10, l11]
l13: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 ⇒ ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) → dt u M t2 w r1 = dt u M t2 w r2 $ by imp_intro [l12]
l14: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_ha_q M u w r1 r2 t2 , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r1 ∊ fseq u , r2 ∊ fseq u , ra_has_arg y t2 ∈ lrel , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r1 ⇒ ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ f , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w r2 → ∀ x0 (o' x0 = n' x0) → dt u M t2 w r1 = dt u M t2 w r2 $ by imp_intro [l13]
