l1: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f9_fw_q J M u w v s t1 t3 tz ts , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , jval u M J , uadm u , w ∊ lvals , v ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , t1 ∊ trees ω , tz = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , ts = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , nadd (nvf' tz) (cdm v) = nvf' ts , ∀ x4 ∀ x5 (x4 ∊ cdm v → x5 ∊ trees ω → nvf' x5 = nadd (nvf' tz) x4 → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = v' x4) , ra_fir t1 t3 c d y ∈ lrel3 J , c ∊ trees ω , ra_closed n y ∈ lrel , q ∊ fseq u , r ∊ fseq u , cdm q = nadd (nvf' d) (nvf' t3) , cdm r = cdm q , nvf' n = nadd (cdm q) (cdm v) , q ++ s ∈ sat u M c w , r ++ s ∈ sat u M c w , e = q ++ v , g = r ++ v , ⟨ a , ⟨ b , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w e , ⟨ k , ⟨ l , ⟨ m , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w g ⇒ crn j ⊆ f9_fw_q J M u w v s t1 t3 tz ts $ by ax
