l96: $ G , r = ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w , d = sf ++ p , ⟨ nvf' ti , ⟨ d , n ⟩ ⟩ ∈ r ∧ sx = {y | ¬ iprop td (nvf' ti) w ∧ y ∊ n} , v ∊ u ∧ ∀ o (⟨ ⟨ nvf' ti , ⟨ d , {y | ¬ iprop td (nvf' ti) w ∧ y ∊ n} ⟩ ⟩ , o ⟩ ∈ ifold u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w p mv ↔ o = v) ⇒ d = d $ by eq_refl
