l70: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ m ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq V ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) c ∧ m ∊ V ∧ s = scons m c ⇒ s ∊ fseq V ∧ ssnoc s a ∈ {z | ∃ c ∃ d ∃ h ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ V ∧ z = scons m c)} $ by isset_elim [l69, l68]
l71: $ G , ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ m ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq V ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) c ∧ m ∊ V ∧ s = scons m c) ⇒ ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ m ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq V ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) c ∧ m ∊ V ∧ s = scons m c) $ by ax
