l73: $ G , ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ m ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq V ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) c ∧ m ∊ V ∧ s = scons m c) ⇒ ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ m ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq V ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) c ∧ m ∊ V ∧ s = scons m c) $ by ax
