l102: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y $ by ax
l103: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ $ by ax
l104: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ ⟨ e , n ⟩ = ⟨ b , f ⟩ $ by eq_trans [eq_sym [l103], and_elim_l [and_elim_r [l102]]]
l105: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ e = b $ by opair_inj_l [l104]
l106: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ n = f $ by opair_inj_r [l104]
l107: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ e ∊ fseq u $ by wcel_welc [wcel_eq_l [eq_sym [l105], welc_wcel [and_elim_l [l102]]]]
l108: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
l109: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ ⟨ ssnoc e a , n ⟩ ∈ Y $ by wcel_eq_l [opair_eq [ssnoc_eq [eq_sym [l105], l108], eq_sym [l106]], and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l102]]]
l110: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ fseq u → ap (Y2) q = ap (Y) (ssnoc q a)) $ by weaken [#7]
l111: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y ⇒ e ∊ fseq u → ap (Y2) e = ap (Y) (ssnoc e a) $ by all_elim [l110]
