l114: $ G , l ∊ {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) ∧ n ∊ ap ({v | ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ fseq u ∧ v = ⟨ q , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc q a , y ⟩ ∈ Y)}) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , g = ⟨ e , n ⟩ , ∃ f (b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y) ⇒ ∃ f (b ∊ fseq u ∧ g = ⟨ b , f ⟩ ∧ ⟨ ssnoc b a , f ⟩ ∈ Y) $ by ax
