l21: $ G , a ∊ dt u M ta w r , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) (Y2) ⇒ s ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc s a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y) $ by cab_elim [l20]
