l23: $ G , a ∊ dt u M ta w r , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) (Y2) ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ fseq u → ap (T2) q = ap (T) (ssnoc q a)) $ by weaken [l12]
l24: $ G , a ∊ dt u M ta w r , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) (Y2) ⇒ s ∊ fseq u → ap (T2) s = ap (T) (ssnoc s a) $ by all_elim [l23]
