l26: $ G , a ∊ dt u M ta w r , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) (Y2) ⇒ ap (T2) s ⊆ ap (T) (ssnoc s a) $ by eq_subset [l25]
l27: $ G , a ∊ dt u M ta w r ⇒ ∀ s (s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) (Y2) → ap (T2) s ⊆ ap (T) (ssnoc s a)) $ by all_intro [imp_intro [l26]]
l28: $ G , a ∊ dt u M ta w r ⇒ fpi s (mpth u (dnf u M) tb w (scons a r) (Y2)) (ap (T2) s) ⊆ fpi s {x | x ∊ fseq u ∧ ssnoc x a ∈ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y)} (ap (T) (ssnoc s a)) $ by fpi_sub [l17, l27]
