l45: $ G , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ d ∃ h ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ s = scons m c) $ by cab_elim [l44]
