l62: $ G , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ s = scons n e ⇒ ta ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [l1]
l63: $ G , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ s = scons n e ⇒ tb ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
l64: $ G , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ s = scons n e ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#4]
l65: $ G , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ s = scons n e ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#5]
l66: $ G , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ s = scons n e ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t (x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' ta) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x r) ∧ e = ssnoc f x ∧ i = scons x g ∧ j = scons (etel u (dnf u M) ta w r) t) $ by etel_pi_all [l62, l63, l64, l65, and_elim_l [l61]]
l67: $ G , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ s = scons n e , x ∊ da ((dnf u M)' ta) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x r) ∧ e = ssnoc f x ∧ i = scons x g ∧ j = scons (etel u (dnf u M) ta w r) t , p = scons x r , v = scons n f ⇒ ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ s = scons n e $ by ax
