l46: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e $ by ax
l47: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [#6]
l48: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by csn_elim_c [wcel_eq_r [l47, and_elim_l [l46]]]
l49: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ isset e $ by isset_var
l50: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
l51: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ e = ∅ $ by opair_inj_l_c [l48, l49, l50]
l52: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ dt u M ti w r = ap (Y) ∅ $ by weaken [#7]
