l54: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ n ∊ dt u M ti w r $ by welc_eq [eq_sym [eq_trans [l52, ap_eq [l53, eq_sym [l51]]]], and_elim_l [and_elim_r [l46]]]
l55: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ n = n $ by eq_refl
l56: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ l = scons n ∅ $ by eq_trans [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l46]]], scons_eq [l55, l51]]
l57: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ ∃ b (b ∊ dt u M ti w r ∧ l = scons b ∅) $ by ex_intro [and_intro [l54, l56]]
l58: $ G , l ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w r ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ l ∊ {x | ∃ b (b ∊ dt u M ti w r ∧ x = scons b ∅)} $ by cab_intro [l57]
