l74: $ G , l ∊ fpi s {x | ∃ b (b ∊ dt u M ti w r ∧ x = scons b ∅)} (ap (T) s) ⇒ l ∊ fpi s {x | ∃ b (b ∊ dt u M ti w r ∧ x = scons b ∅)} (ap (T) s) $ by ax
l75: $ G , l ∊ fpi s {x | ∃ b (b ∊ dt u M ti w r ∧ x = scons b ∅)} (ap (T) s) ⇒ l ∊ cpi a (dt u M ti w r) (ap (T) (scons a ∅)) $ by fpi_cpi1 [l74]
