l77: $ G , s ∊ {x | ∃ b (b ∊ dt u M ti w r ∧ x = scons b ∅)} ⇒ ap (T) s ⊆ ap (T) s $ by subset_refl
l78: $ G ⇒ ∀ s (s ∊ {x | ∃ b (b ∊ dt u M ti w r ∧ x = scons b ∅)} → ap (T) s ⊆ ap (T) s) $ by all_intro [imp_intro [l77]]
l79: $ G , s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) ⇒ ap (T) s ⊆ ap (T) s $ by subset_refl
l80: $ G ⇒ ∀ s (s ∊ mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y) → ap (T) s ⊆ ap (T) s) $ by all_intro [imp_intro [l79]]
l81: $ G ⇒ fpi s {x | ∃ b (b ∊ dt u M ti w r ∧ x = scons b ∅)} (ap (T) s) = fpi s (mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y)) (ap (T) s) $ by subset_antisym [fpi_sub [l68, l78], fpi_sub [eq_sym [l68], l80]]
l82: $ G ⇒ dt u M ⟨ kc_pi , scons ti (scons tx ∅) ⟩ w r = fpi s (mpth u (dnf u M) tb w r (Y)) (ap (T) s) $ by eq_trans [l69, eq_trans [l71, eq_trans [l76, l81]]]

fpi_eq_pt
---------
l1: $ G , q ∊ Q ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ Q → B = B2) $ by weaken [#2]
l2: $ G , q ∊ Q ⇒ q ∊ Q $ by ax
l3: $ G , q ∊ Q ⇒ B = B2 $ by imp_elim [all_elim [l1], l2]
l4: $ G , q ∊ Q ⇒ B ⊆ B2 $ by eq_subset [l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ Q → B ⊆ B2) $ by all_intro [imp_intro [l4]]
l6: $ G , q ∊ Q2 ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ Q → B = B2) $ by weaken [#2]
l7: $ G , q ∊ Q2 ⇒ Q = Q2 $ by weaken [#1]
l8: $ G , q ∊ Q2 ⇒ q ∊ Q2 $ by ax
l9: $ G , q ∊ Q2 ⇒ q ∊ Q $ by welc_eq [eq_sym [l7], l8]
l10: $ G , q ∊ Q2 ⇒ B = B2 $ by imp_elim [all_elim [l6], l9]
l11: $ G , q ∊ Q2 ⇒ B2 ⊆ B $ by eq_subset [eq_sym [l10]]
l12: $ G ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ Q2 → B2 ⊆ B) $ by all_intro [imp_intro [l11]]
l13: $ G ⇒ fpi q Q B = fpi q Q2 B2 $ by subset_antisym [fpi_sub [#1, l5], fpi_sub [eq_sym [#1], l12]]

--| @freshen G q
lemma f13_ms {q: set} (G: hyps) (E K K2 Y Y2 R R2: class) (u w: set): $ G ⇒ K ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ K = K2 $ > $ G ⇒ R = R2 $ > $ G ⇒ isset R $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ fseq u → ap (Y) q = ap (Y2) q) $ > $ G ⇒ mpth u E K w R (Y) ⊆ mpth u E K2 w R2 (Y2) $
----
l1: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) ⇒ l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) $ by ax
l2: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ d ∃ h ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c $ by ax
l4: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c ⇒ ∃ n (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n c) $ by ex_intro [l3]
l5: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c ⇒ ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n c) $ by ex_intro [l4]
l6: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c ⇒ ∃ j ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n c) $ by ex_intro [l5]
l7: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c ⇒ ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ c , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n c) $ by ex_intro [l6]
l8: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c ⇒ ∃ e ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e) $ by ex_intro [l7]
