l10: $ … ⇒ ∃ e ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e) $ by ex_elim [l9, l8]
l11: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c) ⇒ ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c) $ by ax
l12: $ … ⇒ ∃ e ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e) $ by ex_elim [l11, l10]
