l14: $ … ⇒ ∃ e ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e) $ by ex_elim [l13, l12]
l15: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ∃ d ∃ h ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c) ⇒ ∃ d ∃ h ∃ o ∃ m (⟨ c , ⟨ d , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ m ∊ ap (Y) c ∧ m ∊ u ∧ l = scons m c) $ by ax
l16: $ … ⇒ ∃ e ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e) $ by ex_elim [l15, l14]
l17: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) ⇒ ∃ e ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ n (⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e) $ by ex_elim [l2, l16]
l18: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e $ by ax
l19: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , p = R ⇒ K = K $ by eq_refl
l20: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , p = R ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l21: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , p = R ⇒ p = R $ by ax
l22: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , p = R ⇒ ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w p $ by wcel_eq_r [etel_eq [l19, l20, eq_sym [l21]], weaken [and_elim_l [l18]]]
l23: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , p = R ⇒ K ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
l24: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e , p = R ⇒ e ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [etel_fseq [l23, l22]]
l25: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ isset R $ by weaken [#4]
l26: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ e ∊ fseq u $ by isset_elim [l25, l24]
l27: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ fseq u → ap (Y) q = ap (Y2) q) $ by weaken [#5]
l28: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ e ∊ fseq u → ap (Y) e = ap (Y2) e $ by all_elim [l27]
l29: $ G , l ∊ mpth u E K w R (Y) , ⟨ e , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E K w R ∧ n ∊ ap (Y) e ∧ n ∊ u ∧ l = scons n e ⇒ ap (Y) e = ap (Y2) e $ by imp_elim [l28, l26]
