l262: $ G , e ∊ {l | l ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm l = L2 ∧ ∀ i (i ∊ N → J ⊆ i → vat (l ++ c0) N i ∈ imot u (dnf u M) td i w p V)} , q ∊ fseq u ∧ h ∊ u ∧ e = ssnoc q h , g = scons h ∅ , k = ∅ , c = scons h c0 , y = scons h r , j = J ⇒ esat u (dsh u M r) tm w = {b | ∃ g ∃ q (g ∊ esat u (dsh u M r) tg w ∧ q ∊ esat u (dsh u M (g ++ r)) tmr w ∧ b = q ++ g)} $ by weaken [l1]
l263: $ G , e ∊ {l | l ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm l = L2 ∧ ∀ i (i ∊ N → J ⊆ i → vat (l ++ c0) N i ∈ imot u (dnf u M) td i w p V)} , q ∊ fseq u ∧ h ∊ u ∧ e = ssnoc q h , g = scons h ∅ , k = ∅ , c = scons h c0 , y = scons h r , j = J ⇒ e ∊ esat u (dsh u M r) tm w $ by welc_eq [eq_sym [l262], l261]
