l26: $ G , td = x1 ∧ tnp = x2 ∧ tv = x4 ∧ vn = x3 ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ vm = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ , ty = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ vk = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ vo = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , e ∊ esat u (dsh u M vr) vm w , i ∊ nvf' tn , nvf' vn ⊆ i ⇒ nvf' tn = nvf' vn $ by weaken [l16]
