lemma f17_si_step (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w t1 t3 t4 p s x y: set): $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ p ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ cdm p = nvf' t4 $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ x ∊ u $ > $ G ⇒ y ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ y ∈ f17_sip u M t1 t3 t4 w p s $ > $ G ⇒ scons x y ∈ f17_sip u M t1 t3 t4 w p s $
----
c1: $ G , z = scons x y , ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel , j ∊ trees ω , nadd (nvf' j) (cdm z) = nvf' t3 , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → nvf' b = nadd (nvf' j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = z' i) ⇒ ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel $ by ax
c2: $ G , z = scons x y , ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel , j ∊ trees ω , nadd (nvf' j) (cdm z) = nvf' t3 , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → nvf' b = nadd (nvf' j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = z' i) ⇒ z = scons x y $ by ax
c3: $ G , z = scons x y , ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel , j ∊ trees ω , nadd (nvf' j) (cdm z) = nvf' t3 , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → nvf' b = nadd (nvf' j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = z' i) ⇒ j ∊ trees ω $ by ax
c4: $ G , z = scons x y , ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel , j ∊ trees ω , nadd (nvf' j) (cdm z) = nvf' t3 , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → nvf' b = nadd (nvf' j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = z' i) ⇒ nadd (nvf' j) (cdm z) = nvf' t3 $ by ax
c5a: $ G , z = scons x y , ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel , j ∊ trees ω , nadd (nvf' j) (cdm z) = nvf' t3 , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → nvf' b = nadd (nvf' j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = z' i) ⇒ ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → nvf' b = nadd (nvf' j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = z' i) $ by ax
c5: $ … ⇒ f17_sih u M t1 w z j $ by f17_id [c5a]
h1: $ G , z = scons x y , ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel , j ∊ trees ω , nadd (nvf' j) (cdm z) = nvf' t3 , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → nvf' b = nadd (nvf' j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = z' i) ⇒ t1 ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
