l3: $ G ⇒ ∀ a (w ∊ lvals → r ∊ fseq u → ∀ b (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tY w r → b ∊ fseq {y | y = y}) → ra_rehead tY tX vk ty vm ∈ lrel → ty ∊ trees ω → vm ∊ trees ω → ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ty w r → ∃ i ∃ b (a = i ++ b ∧ i ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm i = nvf' vk ∧ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tY w r ∧ dt u M vm w r = apn (dt u M tX w r) i)) $ by all_elim [l2]
