lemma f17_rehead_args_all (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w r tY tX: set): $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f17_rehead_args_q M u w r tY tX $
----
l1: $ G , e ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f17_rehead_args_q M u w r tY tX , d = ⟨ e , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u , ∀ b (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tY w r → b ∊ fseq {y | y = y}) , ra_rehead tY tX k d m ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , m ∊ trees ω , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w r ⇒ crn j ⊆ f17_rehead_args_q M u w r tY tX $ by ax
l2: $ G , e ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f17_rehead_args_q M u w r tY tX , d = ⟨ e , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u , ∀ b (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tY w r → b ∊ fseq {y | y = y}) , ra_rehead tY tX k d m ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , m ∊ trees ω , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w r ⇒ d = ⟨ e , j ⟩ $ by ax
l3: $ G , e ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f17_rehead_args_q M u w r tY tX , d = ⟨ e , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u , ∀ b (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tY w r → b ∊ fseq {y | y = y}) , ra_rehead tY tX k d m ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , m ∊ trees ω , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w r ⇒ e ∊ ω $ by ax
