l130: $ G , td = x1 ∧ tnp = x2 ∧ tn = x3 ∧ tmo = x4 ∧ tfld = x5 ∧ vd = x6 ∧ tj = x7 ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons x9 ∅) ⟩ ∧ vm = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_ihty x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_s , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ x7 x9 n ∈ lrel , a ∊ dt u M x8 w vr , l ∊ tpth (etel u (dnf u M) x9 w (scons a vr)) , ⟨ l , ⟨ g , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x9 w (scons a vr) ⇒ ⟨ ssnoc l a , ⟨ scons a g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) x8 w vr) h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons x9 ∅) ⟩ w vr $ by etel_pi_intro [l126, l127, l128, l129, l123, l125, l105]
l131: $ G , td = x1 ∧ tnp = x2 ∧ tn = x3 ∧ tmo = x4 ∧ tfld = x5 ∧ vd = x6 ∧ tj = x7 ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons x9 ∅) ⟩ ∧ vm = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_ihty x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_s , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ x7 x9 n ∈ lrel , a ∊ dt u M x8 w vr , l ∊ tpth (etel u (dnf u M) x9 w (scons a vr)) , ⟨ l , ⟨ g , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x9 w (scons a vr) , j = ssnoc l a ⇒ j = ssnoc l a $ by ax
l132: $ G , td = x1 ∧ tnp = x2 ∧ tn = x3 ∧ tmo = x4 ∧ tfld = x5 ∧ vd = x6 ∧ tj = x7 ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons x9 ∅) ⟩ ∧ vm = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_ihty x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_s , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ x7 x9 n ∈ lrel , a ∊ dt u M x8 w vr , l ∊ tpth (etel u (dnf u M) x9 w (scons a vr)) , ⟨ l , ⟨ g , ⟨ h , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x9 w (scons a vr) , j = ssnoc l a ⇒ ⟨ scons a g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) x8 w vr) h , o ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ scons a g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) x8 w vr) h , o ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_refl
