l236: $ G , td = x1 ∧ tnp = x2 ∧ tn = x3 ∧ tmo = x4 ∧ tfld = x5 ∧ vd = x6 ∧ tj = x7 ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons x9 ∅) ⟩ ∧ vm = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_ihty x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_s , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ x7 x9 n ∈ lrel , z ∊ tpth (etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons x9 ∅) ⟩ w vr) , ⟨ z , ⟨ d , ⟨ m , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons x8 (scons x9 ∅) ⟩ w vr , e ∊ da ((dnf u M)' x8) w vr ∧ e ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x9 w (scons e vr) ∧ z = ssnoc f e ∧ d = scons e g ∧ m = scons (etel u (dnf u M) x8 w vr) t , p = scons e vr ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x9 w p $ by wcel_eq_r [etel_eq [l233, l234, eq_sym [l235]], weaken [and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l232]]]]]
