lemma f18_rl_all (G: hyps) (td tn tnp tj: set): $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj $
----
l1: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel ⇒ crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj $ by ax
l2: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel ⇒ y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ by ax
l3: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by ax
l4: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
l5: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel $ by ax
l6: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel ⇒ nvf' tj ∈ nvf' tn $ by f18_rl_n [l1, l2, l3, l4, l5]
l7: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ ⇒ ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel → nvf' tj ∈ nvf' tn $ by imp_intro [l6]
l8: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ ⇒ ∀ d (ra_recfield td tn tnp d y tj ∈ lrel → nvf' tj ∈ nvf' tn) $ by all_intro [l7]
l9: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj $ by cab_intro [l8]
l10: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ ⇒ y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ by ax
l11: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj $ by wcel_intro [l10, l9]
l12: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj ⇒ isset ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ by opair_isset
l13: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj $ by isset_elim [l12, l11]
l14: $ G ⇒ i ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj → ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj $ by imp_intro [imp_intro [imp_intro [l13]]]
l15: $ G ⇒ ∀ i ∀ j (i ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj → ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj) $ by all_intro [all_intro [l14]]
l16: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l17: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f18_rl_q td tn tnp tj $ by trees_ind_c [l16, l15]

