l1: $ G ⇒ dt u M tA3 w rm ∈ u $ by dt_in_u [#1, #8, #2, #3]
l2: $ G ⇒ dt u M tA3 w rm ⊆ u $ by universe_elem_subset_c [uadm_universe [#1], l1]
