l4: $ G ⇒ isset (etel u (dnf u M) tA w rk) $ by etel_set [l3]
l5: $ G , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons tA (scons tB ∅) ⟩ w rk ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons tA (scons tB ∅) ⟩ w rk $ by ax
