l1: $ G , H ⇒ ra_mwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G , H ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ qdp ∃ qkn ∃ f ∃ qA ∃ qA3 ∃ qB ∃ qMin (t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = v ∧ t6 = w ∧ t7 = a ∧ t8 = b ∧ t9 = c ∧ t10 = f ∧ t11 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA (scons qB ∅) ⟩ ∧ t12 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA3 (scons qMin ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add b y qdp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qdp qA ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add u z qkn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift qkn b qA qA3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_mwalk x y z u v w a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ c f qB qMin ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ qdp ∃ qkn ∃ qj_v ∃ qa_v ∃ qsh ∃ qfld ∃ qmo ∃ f ∃ qA ∃ qA2 ∃ qA3 ∃ qA4 ∃ qB ∃ qIH ∃ qMin (t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = v ∧ t6 = w ∧ t7 = a ∧ t8 = b ∧ t9 = c ∧ t10 = f ∧ t11 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA (scons qB ∅) ⟩ ∧ t12 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA3 (scons qMin ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add b y qdp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_recfield x z y b qA qj_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ z qdp qA qA2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add u z qkn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift qkn b qA2 qA3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add c a qa_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qsh b qa_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qfld ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ qsh ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qa_v u qmo ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift qsh ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qA3 qA4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ihty x y z qmo qfld ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qj_v qA4 qIH ∈ lrel ∧ ra_mwalk x y z u v w a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cons , scons qIH (scons f ∅) ⟩ qB qMin ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ b ∃ c ∃ qdp ∃ qkn ∃ qh0 ∃ qh1 ∃ qh_v ∃ qni ∃ qmi ∃ qa_v ∃ qb_v ∃ f ∃ g ∃ qK2 ∃ qK3 ∃ qY ∃ qX ∃ qY1 ∃ qY2 ∃ qMin (t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = v ∧ t6 = w ∧ t7 = b ∧ t8 = b ∧ t9 = c ∧ t10 = f ∧ t11 = g ∧ t12 = qMin ∧ ra_add b y qdp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add u z qkn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qdp v qh0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qh0 qkn qh1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qh1 c qh_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift qkn b g qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qK2 qK3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x v qni ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead qY ⟨ kc_bvar , scons qmi ∅ ⟩ qni qK3 qX ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons qh_v ∅ ⟩ qY y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add c b qa_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qa_v qkn qb_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qmi ⟨ kc_s , scons v ∅ ⟩ qb_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , scons x (scons v (scons w ∅)) ⟩ qb_v y qY1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs qY1 c b qY2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis f ⟨ kc_app , scons qX (scons qY2 ∅) ⟩ qMin ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_mwalk_cases [l1]
