l58: $ G ⇒ ∀ f ∀ g ∀ c ∀ o (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ty w vq → vh ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx → esat u (dsh u M (f ++ vp)) vh w = ihv td tK0 (imrel td cv) (vl ++ g) (vt ++ c) (nvf' vd)) → dt u M vm w vp = fpi z (mqp (etel u (dnf u M) ty w vq) td tK0 (imrel td cv) vl vt (nvf' tnf)) (ap (mtb u (etel u (dnf u M) ty w vq) td tK0 (imrel td cv) vl vt (nvf' tnf) (cv' Km) (CT) vk pp (NI)) z) ∧ ∀ f ∀ g ∀ c ∀ o (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ty w vq → ihv td tK0 (imrel td cv) (vl ++ g) (vt ++ c) (nvf' tnf) ⊆ fseq u) $ by imp_elim [l57, #46]
