l21: $ G , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ty w vq , vh ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx ⇒ ∀ f ∀ g ∀ c ∀ o (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ c , o ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ty w vq → vh ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx → esat u (dsh u M (f ++ vp)) vh w = ihv td tK0 (imrel td cv) (vl ++ g) (vt ++ c) (nvf' vd)) $ by weaken [#46]
