l6: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons j ∅) ⟩ ∧ vm = ⟨ kc_pi , scons i (scons k ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add vd tnp v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed v b ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tk tn a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift a vd b i ∈ lrel ∧ ra_mwalk td tnp tn tk ti tc tnf ⟨ kc_s , scons vd ∅ ⟩ vr vh j k ∈ lrel ⇒ ty = ⟨ k1 , j1 ⟩ $ by weaken [#2]
