l11: $ H ⇒ t1 = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons qK (scons qC ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qn_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_clen_c qC qn_v ∈ lrel → Cf $ by imp_intro [#3]
