l14: $ G , H , ∃ qn_v (t1 = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons qK (scons qC ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qn_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_clen_c qC qn_v ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ qn_v (t1 = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons qK (scons qC ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qn_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_clen_c qC qn_v ∈ lrel) $ by ax
