l19: $ G , H , ∃ qc_v ∃ x (t1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons qF (scons qC (scons qT ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qn_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c qC qc_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qc_v x ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ qc_v ∃ x (t1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons qF (scons qC (scons qT ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qn_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c qC qc_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qc_v x ∈ lrel) $ by ax
