l272: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons h (scons d (scons p ∅)) ⟩ ∧ ra_cminors td tnp tn vk vd ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c d n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add vk n k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors td tnp tn k ⟨ kc_s , scons vd ∅ ⟩ p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp q m vm ∈ lrel , ty = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ vq = ⟨ kc_s , scons j ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_ntys x3 j x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c x2 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x5 vr ∈ lrel , x7 = ⟨ kc_s , scons vd ∅ ⟩ , t = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , x6 = nvf' k , b ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_nat , ra_minor_idx tt g b o ∈ lrel ∧ nvf' g = nadd (nvf' t) (nvf' vd) ∧ nvf' o = nadd (nvf' b) (nvf' vk) ⇒ iprt td tp tt $ by weaken [#16]
