l24: $ G , dd = x1 ∧ nv = x2 ∧ np = x3 ∧ lv = x4 ∧ iv = x5 ∧ cx = x6 ∧ bb = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons f (scons c (scons t ∅)) ⟩ ∧ ra_isort f x8 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x7 x4 ∧ ra_ctors_wf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 c ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_tys_wf x1 x2 x3 x4 ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x6 t ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ f = y1 ∧ c = y2 ∧ t = y3 $ by node3_inj [wcel_isset [l23], eq_trans [eq_sym [and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l22]]]]]]]], weaken [#2]]]
