l12: $ G , x1 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , tq = ⟨ kc_cons , scons d (scons e ∅) ⟩ ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_s , scons f ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_clen e f ∈ lrel ⇒ ¬ kc_nz = kc_s $ by kc_nz_ne_s
