l1: $ G , H ⇒ ra_motives t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G , H ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u (t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = u ∧ t4 = z ∧ t5 = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t6 = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩) ∨ ∃ x ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ qF ∃ qF2 ∃ qMj ∃ qC ∃ qT ∃ qMr ∃ v (t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = u ∧ t4 = z ∧ t5 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons qF (scons qC (scons qT ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t6 = v ∧ ra_lift z ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qF qF2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_mty x y z ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ u qF2 qMj ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x y u ⟨ kc_s , scons z ∅ ⟩ qT qMr ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qMr ⟨ kc_cons , scons qMj (scons ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ v ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_motives_cases [l1]
