l16: $ G , H , t1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA (scons qB ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qk_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ ra_isort qB qk_v x ∈ lrel ⇒ qk_v = qk_v $ by eq_refl
l17: $ G , H , t1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA (scons qB ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qk_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ ra_isort qB qk_v x ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_isort qB qk_v t3 ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [ra_isort_eq [l15, l16, eq_sym [and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l14]]]]], and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l14]]]]
