l19: $ H ⇒ t1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA (scons qB ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qk_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_isort qB qk_v t3 ∈ lrel → Cf $ by imp_intro [#3]
