l26: $ G , H , ∃ qB ∃ qk_v ∃ x (t1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA (scons qB ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qk_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ ra_isort qB qk_v x ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ qB ∃ qk_v ∃ x (t1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons qA (scons qB ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons qk_v ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x ∧ ra_isort qB qk_v x ∈ lrel) $ by ax
