l93: $ G , vn = ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons vd ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_pargs tX ⟨ kc_s , scons vd ∅ ⟩ k e ∈ lrel , x2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons vd ∅ ⟩ ⇒ k ∈ trees ω $ by crn_scons_head_trees [l92, l91]
l94: $ G , vn = ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons vd ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_pargs tX ⟨ kc_s , scons vd ∅ ⟩ k e ∈ lrel , x2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons vd ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ra_spine tX ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons vd ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ∈ lrel $ by lrel_spine_s [l66, l80, l65, l93, l48]
