lemma f29_st_all (G: hyps) (th tx ta: set): $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f29_st_q th tx ta $
----
l1: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f29_st_q th tx ta , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_spine th tx ta ∈ lrel , ra_spine tx y b ∈ lrel ⇒ crn x9 ⊆ f29_st_q th tx ta $ by ax
l2: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f29_st_q th tx ta , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_spine th tx ta ∈ lrel , ra_spine tx y b ∈ lrel ⇒ y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ $ by ax
l3: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f29_st_q th tx ta , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_spine th tx ta ∈ lrel , ra_spine tx y b ∈ lrel ⇒ x8 ∊ ω $ by ax
l4: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f29_st_q th tx ta , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , ra_spine th tx ta ∈ lrel , ra_spine tx y b ∈ lrel ⇒ x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
