l15: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f30_si_q td tn ta tb , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f30_si_q td tn ta tb $ by wcel_intro [l14, l13]
