l27: $ G ⇒ ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (x8 ∊ ω → x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn x9 ⊆ f30_sb_q td tn ti → ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f30_sb_q td tn ti) $ by all_intro [all_intro [l26]]
l28: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l29: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f30_sb_q td tn ti $ by trees_ind_c [l28, l27]

