l131: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ vm = ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_spine th e k ∈ lrel , vz = ⟨ kc_app , scons f (scons g ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_sinst td tj tn tk e f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td tj tn tk d g ∈ lrel , ra_spine h f k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td tj tn tk th h ∈ lrel ⇒ kr_sinst ∈ ω $ by kr_sinst_omega
