lemma f31_pe_all (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w s tt a: set): $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a $
----
l1: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a $ by ax
l2: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ $ by ax
l3: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ x8 ∊ ω $ by ax
l4: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
l5: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by ax
l6: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ by ax
l7: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel $ by ax
l8: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w $ by ax
l9: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) $ by ax
l10: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) ⇒ ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s) $ by f31_pe_n [l1, l2, l3, l4, l5, l6, l7, l8, l9]
l11: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w ⇒ ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s) $ by imp_intro [l10]
l12: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u , ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel ⇒ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s) $ by imp_intro [l11]
l13: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , s ∊ fseq u ⇒ ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel → p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s) $ by imp_intro [l12]
l14: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , w ∊ lvals ⇒ s ∊ fseq u → ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel → p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s) $ by imp_intro [l13]
l15: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ lvals → s ∊ fseq u → ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel → p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s) $ by imp_intro [l14]
l16: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ t (w ∊ lvals → s ∊ fseq u → ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel → p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s)) $ by all_intro [l15]
l17: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ g ∀ t (w ∊ lvals → s ∊ fseq u → ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel → p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s)) $ by all_intro [l16]
l18: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ x ∀ g ∀ t (w ∊ lvals → s ∊ fseq u → ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel → p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s)) $ by all_intro [l17]
l19: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ p ∀ x ∀ g ∀ t (w ∊ lvals → s ∊ fseq u → ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel → p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s)) $ by all_intro [l18]
l20: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ b ∀ p ∀ x ∀ g ∀ t (w ∊ lvals → s ∊ fseq u → ra_pis y b tt ∈ lrel → p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) y w → ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) b w (p ++ s) → ∃ h ∃ l (⟨ x ++ p , ⟨ h , ⟨ l , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tt w s)) $ by all_intro [l19]
l21: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a $ by cab_intro [l20]
l22: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ $ by ax
l23: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a $ by wcel_intro [l22, l21]
l24: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a ⇒ isset ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ $ by opair_isset
l25: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a ⇒ ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a $ by isset_elim [l24, l23]
l26: $ G ⇒ x8 ∊ ω → x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a → ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a $ by imp_intro [imp_intro [imp_intro [l25]]]
l27: $ G ⇒ ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (x8 ∊ ω → x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn x9 ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a → ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a) $ by all_intro [all_intro [l26]]
l28: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l29: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f31_pe_q M u w s tt a $ by trees_ind_c [l28, l27]

pis_etel_intro
--------------
l1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ kr_pis , scons tq (scons tb (scons tt ∅)) ⟩ ∈ latoms $ by lrel_latoms [#3]
l2: $ G ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
l3: $ G ⇒ isset (scons tt ∅) $ by scons_set [l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ isset (scons tb (scons tt ∅)) $ by scons_set [l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ isset (scons tq (scons tb (scons tt ∅))) $ by scons_set [l4]
