lemma f31_ts_all (G: hyps) (J M K S: class) (u w c r tA: set): $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ f31_ts_q J M K S u w c r tA $
----
l1: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_ts_q J M K S u w c r tA , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , jval u M J , uadm u , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ sat u M c w , isset K , ¬ K = kc_app , dt u M ⟨ K , S ⟩ w r ∈ dt u M tA w r , ra_sty c ⟨ K , S ⟩ tA y t ∈ lrel3 J , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr ⇒ crn x9 ⊆ f31_ts_q J M K S u w c r tA $ by ax
l2: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f31_ts_q J M K S u w c r tA , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , jval u M J , uadm u , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ sat u M c w , isset K , ¬ K = kc_app , dt u M ⟨ K , S ⟩ w r ∈ dt u M tA w r , ra_sty c ⟨ K , S ⟩ tA y t ∈ lrel3 J , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr ⇒ y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ $ by ax
