l22: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ ve = tb , ty = ⟨ kc_s , scons m ∅ ⟩ ∧ vf = ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_add tc m k ∈ lrel ⇒ kc_s ∈ ω $ by kc_s_omega
