l6: $ G ⇒ mv ∊ ivals k u (inmin td) {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx td i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u (dnf u (mcv H)) td i c w p cv ∧ ihasc td i c)} $ by weaken [l5]
