--------
l1: $ G ⇒ iwf u H J tg td w r0 $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by wcel_welc [iwf_lvals [l1]]
l3: $ G ⇒ mv ∊ imins u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w p cv $ by weaken [#6]
l4: $ G ⇒ mv ∊ ivals k u (inmin td) {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx td i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u (dnf u (mcv H)) td i c w p cv ∧ ihasc td i c)} $ by weaken [l3]
