l5: $ G ⇒ ⟨ q1 , ⟨ q2 , ⟨ q3 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons ta (scons tb ∅) ⟩ w r $ by weaken [#5]
l6: $ G ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x1 ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x1 r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc x2 x1 ∧ q2 = scons x1 x3) $ by etel_pi_elim [l1, l2, l3, l4, l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ ta ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
l8: $ G ⇒ tb ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
