l71: $ G , x1 ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x1 ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x1 r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc x2 x1 ∧ q2 = scons x1 x3 ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t (x ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc f x ∧ q2 = scons x g ∧ q3 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) ta w r) t) $ by ex_elim [l13, l70]
l72: $ G , ∃ x4 (x1 ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x1 ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x1 r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc x2 x1 ∧ q2 = scons x1 x3) ⇒ ∃ x4 (x1 ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x1 ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x1 r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc x2 x1 ∧ q2 = scons x1 x3) $ by ax
l73: $ … ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t (x ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc f x ∧ q2 = scons x g ∧ q3 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) ta w r) t) $ by ex_elim [l72, l71]
l74: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x1 ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x1 r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc x2 x1 ∧ q2 = scons x1 x3) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x1 ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x1 r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc x2 x1 ∧ q2 = scons x1 x3) $ by ax
l75: $ … ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t (x ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc f x ∧ q2 = scons x g ∧ q3 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) ta w r) t) $ by ex_elim [l74, l73]
l76: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x1 ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x1 r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc x2 x1 ∧ q2 = scons x1 x3) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x1 ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x1 ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x1 r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc x2 x1 ∧ q2 = scons x1 x3) $ by ax
l77: $ … ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t (x ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc f x ∧ q2 = scons x g ∧ q3 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) ta w r) t) $ by ex_elim [l76, l75]
l78: $ G ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t (x ∊ dt u M ta w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) tb w (scons x r) ∧ q1 = ssnoc f x ∧ q2 = scons x g ∧ q3 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) ta w r) t) $ by ex_elim [l6, l77]

