l1: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f39_q H J MV u w r0 tg td tb tp tt tnp tn tm tv tnf tK0 p cv mv pf pg pt pa ss c0 xs , x0 = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , iwf u H J tg td w r0 , ra_ind_data td tb tp tt ∈ lrel , ra_ntys tt tn tm ∈ lrel , ra_clen tp tnp ∈ lrel , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tp w , cv ∊ imots u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w p (lv tv w) , mv ∊ imins u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w p cv , ra_elim_ok tg td tv ∈ lrel3 J , tK0 ∊ trees ω , ⟨ pf , ⟨ pg , ⟨ pt , pa ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) tK0 w (p ++ ixs td w (ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w)) , ∀ j ∀ b ∀ e ∀ z (ra_nth_ty tt j b e ∈ lrel → nvf' j ∈ nvf' tn → z ∊ fseq u → dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_ind_rec , scons td (scons j (scons tv ∅)) ⟩ w z = irc u (dnf u (mcv H)) td (nvf' j) (lv tv w) w) , ss ∊ fseq u , cdm (mv ++ cv) = nadd (nvf' tm) (nvf' tn) , c0 = mv ++ cv , xs ∊ fseq u , cdm xs = nvf' tn , ∀ j ∀ b (j ∊ cdm xs → b ∊ trees ω → nvf' b = j → dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons td (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = xs' j) , ra_rwalk td tnp tn tm tv tnf d a x0 v ∈ lrel , v ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , d ∊ trees ω , ra_closed x x0 ∈ lrel , nvf' x = nadd (nadd (nvf' d) (nvf' tnp)) (nvf' tn) , ra_npis x0 n ∈ lrel , nadd (nvf' n) (nvf' d) = nvf' tnf , ∀ b ∀ e ∀ m (ra_nth_pi x0 b e ∈ lrel → ra_add d b m ∈ lrel → ra_nth_pi tK0 m e ∈ lrel) , k ∊ fseq u , cdm k = nvf' d , t ∊ fseq u , cdm t = nvf' d , h ∊ fseq {y | y = y} , cdm h = nvf' d , r = k ++ c0 ++ p ++ ss , l = k ++ p ++ xs , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ c , pa ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) x0 w l , pg = t ++ g , pt = h ++ c , ∀ z (z ∊ ihv td tK0 (ifold u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w p mv) pg pt (nvf' d) → dt u (mcv H) a w (f ++ r) = apn MV (z ++ f ++ k)) ⇒ crn x9 ⊆ f39_q H J MV u w r0 tg td tb tp tt tnp tn tm tv tnf tK0 p cv mv pf pg pt pa ss c0 xs $ by ax
