ifam_pt_path
------------
l1: $ G ⇒ icwf J td $ by ind_wf_icwf_c [iwf_wf [#1]]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∃ b (ra_ind_data td b tp tt ∈ lrel) $ by ex_intro [#2]
l3: $ G ⇒ iprt td tp tt $ by weaken [l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ uadm u $ by iwf_uadm [#1]
l5: $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by wcel_welc [iwf_lvals [#1]]
l6: $ G ⇒ td ∊ trees ω $ by wcel_welc [lsig_ofsort_trees [wcel_welc [iwf_sort [#1]]]]
l7: $ G ⇒ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w ∈ u $ by ifam_universe [#1]
l8: $ G ⇒ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by ifam_sub
l9: $ G , z = ⟨ sj , ⟨ sa , sx ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ sj , ⟨ sa , sx ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
l10: $ G , z = ⟨ sj , ⟨ sa , sx ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ sj , ⟨ sa , sx ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w $ by weaken [#3]
l11: $ G , z = ⟨ sj , ⟨ sa , sx ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w $ by wcel_welc [wcel_eq_l [eq_sym [l9], l10]]
l12: $ G , z = ⟨ sj , ⟨ sa , sx ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ x (x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w x) $ by ifam_elim [l11]
l13: $ G , z = ⟨ sj , ⟨ sa , sx ⟩ ⟩ , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w x ⇒ x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w x $ by ax
l14: $ G , z = ⟨ sj , ⟨ sa , sx ⟩ ⟩ , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w x ⇒ x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u (mcv H)) td w $ by and_elim_l [l13]
