l5: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f49_fp_q J M u w td tn tnp xs s tz , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ , jval u M J , uadm u , w ∊ lvals , xs ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , td ∊ trees ω , tz = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , nadd (nvf' tz) (cdm xs) = nvf' tn , ∀ x4 ∀ x5 (x4 ∊ cdm xs → x5 ∊ trees ω → nvf' x5 = nadd (nvf' tz) x4 → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons td (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = xs' x4) , ra_fprops td tn tnp c d n y ∈ lrel3 J , q ∊ fseq u , cdm q = nadd (nvf' d) (nvf' tnp) , q ++ s ∈ sat u M c w , e = q ++ xs ++ s , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) y w e ⇒ jval u M J $ by ax
