l344: $ G , iprop td (nvf' ti) w , x9 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ (∃ d ∃ x6 ∃ x2 ∃ b ∃ p ∃ x3 ∃ j ∃ h ∃ n ∃ m ∃ o ∃ v ∃ x7 ∃ c (tg = d ∧ td = x2 ∧ ti = j ∧ tfi = h ∧ ra_ind_data x2 b p x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys x3 m o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp p d x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 j v c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_fprops x2 m n x6 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons h ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel3 J)) → ∀ i (i ∊ suc (nvf' tfi) → (itup td (nvf' ti) ∅ pg w)' (suc i) = pg' i) $ by imp_intro [l343]
l345: $ G , iprop td (nvf' ti) w , x9 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ (∃ d ∃ x2 ∃ b ∃ p ∃ x3 ∃ j ∃ h ∃ v ∃ c ∃ y (tg = d ∧ td = x2 ∧ ti = j ∧ tfi = h ∧ ra_ind_data x2 b p x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 j v c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ y ∈ lrel ∧ lveq ⟨ kc_lmax , scons ⟨ kc_ls , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ (scons y ∅) ⟩ y) ∨ ∃ d ∃ x6 ∃ x2 ∃ b ∃ p ∃ x3 ∃ j ∃ h ∃ n ∃ m ∃ o ∃ v ∃ x7 ∃ c (tg = d ∧ td = x2 ∧ ti = j ∧ tfi = h ∧ ra_ind_data x2 b p x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys x3 m o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp p d x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 j v c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_fprops x2 m n x6 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons h ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel3 J)) → ∀ i (i ∊ suc (nvf' tfi) → (itup td (nvf' ti) ∅ pg w)' (suc i) = pg' i) $ by or_elim_imp [l100, l344]
l346: $ G , iprop td (nvf' ti) w , x9 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ suc (nvf' tfi) → (itup td (nvf' ti) ∅ pg w)' (suc i) = pg' i) $ by imp_elim [l345, l24]
