l11: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_pi , scons tA (scons c ∅) ⟩ ∧ vn = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ tA ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [and_elim_l [l10]]
l12: $ G , ty = ⟨ kc_pi , scons tA (scons c ∅) ⟩ ∧ vn = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ c ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [and_elim_r [l10]]
