l11: $ G , x0 = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ , ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons td (scons j ∅) ⟩ ty x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_aux_of td x0 j x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_arity td n x1 m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x1 n x x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add n k x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spine x3 ty k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pinst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead x3 x5 k ty vz ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons td (scons j ∅) ⟩ ty x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_aux_of td x0 j x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_arity td n x1 m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst td ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x1 n x x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add n k x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spine x3 ty k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pinst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead x3 x5 k ty vz ∈ lrel $ by ax
